# ~/.archon/.env (or $ARCHON_HOME/.env) — secrets Archon hands to workflow nodes.
# Never put these in the Java repository's .env (Archon strips those keys) or in
# .archon/config.yaml `env:` (that file can be committed). Values here are redacted in
# Archon's transcripts, but keep the file private: chmod 600 ~/.archon/.env

# --- GitHub --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Preferred: no token here at all. Run `gh auth login` once; the forge plugin then uses
# `gh auth token` (devflow-smoke reports the credential source it found).
# Only if gh login is not possible, set a token with repo + pull request + checks access:
# GH_TOKEN=ghp_xxx
# Never leave an empty `GH_TOKEN=` line: an empty value refuses instead of falling back
# to gh. Delete the line instead.

# --- Claude --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude runs through your Claude Code subscription login (`claude` then /login).
# For a headless machine, `claude setup-token` prints a long-lived token:
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat01-xxx
#
# Do NOT set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY unless you intend API billing: it is passed to the
# Claude subprocess and switches it from your subscription to per-token API charges.
# It is also what Pi uses for its `anthropic/...` models.

# --- Pi ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pi reads ~/.pi/agent/auth.json (written by `pi /login`) and its own env vars. Put a
# backend key here only when you do not use `pi /login`, for example:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-xxx
# A custom gateway's key can live in ~/.pi/agent/models.json as "$MY_GATEWAY_KEY"
# and be defined here:
# MY_GATEWAY_KEY=xxx

# --- Jira ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing here. jira-cli keeps its own credentials (`jira init`; the API token comes
# from its JIRA_API_TOKEN env var or the OS keychain). If you export JIRA_API_TOKEN for
# jira-cli, put it in your shell profile or here; Archon passes it through unchanged.
